 "link": {
  "id": "link",
  "name": "同生共死",
  "kind": "link",
  "duration": 3,
  "color": "#fd79a8",
  "_note": "阶段3 已迁移为 triggers 驱动，并【按 PDF 系数】实现分摊：①先减免 (22.5+2.5×L)%（priority 20，与旧 onDamaged 第2步同序）；②减免后【剩余部分】由使用者与承受者分担，使用者分担 = 承受者分担 × (50.5−0.5×L)% → 承受者保留 keepFactor = 1/(1+k)、使用者分担 = 剩余×k/(1+k)。每次分担使用者 +1 侠义之心。参数由施加方写入 data：{userId, level, reducePct, shareFactor, keepFactor}。",
  "triggers": [
   {
    "event": "BEFORE_DAMAGE",
    "filter": "self",
    "priority": 20,
    "countAsLayer": false,
    "actions": [
     {
      "type": "modifyValue",
      "op": "cutPct",
      "pct": {
       "ref": "buff.data.reducePct"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "log",
      "text": "{target} 【{buff}】减伤 {delta}（减免后剩 {value}）"
     },
     {
      "type": "modifyValue",
      "op": "mul",
      "coef": {
       "ref": "buff.data.keepFactor"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "rawDamage",
      "targetMode": "buffOwner",
      "flat": {
       "ref": "event.delta"
      },
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "isAlive",
        "target": "buffOwner"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "log",
      "text": "{target} 承 {value}，{buffOwner} 分担 {delta}，获 1 侠义之心",
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "isAlive",
        "target": "buffOwner"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "resource",
      "targetMode": "buffOwner",
      "valor": 1,
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "isAlive",
        "target": "buffOwner"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "chuanxin": {
  "id": "chuanxin",
  "name": "穿心蚀骨",
  "kind": "chuanxin",
  "duration": 5,
  "color": "#e84393",
  "_note": "阶段3 已迁移为 triggers 驱动：①BEFORE_DAMAGE 累池 + 达阈值爆发（priority 60，pool -= extra 而非 threshold）；②BUFF_EXPIRE 到期清算（0.5×池余量 + extra2）。参数由施加方写入 data：{pool, threshold, extra, extra2}。",
  "triggers": [
   {
    "event": "BEFORE_DAMAGE",
    "filter": "self",
    "priority": 60,
    "countAsLayer": false,
    "actions": [
     {
      "type": "modifyVar",
      "scope": "buffData",
      "varName": "pool",
      "op": "add",
      "from": "event.value"
     },
     {
      "type": "modifyVar",
      "scope": "buffData",
      "varName": "__fire",
      "op": "set",
      "value": 0
     },
     {
      "type": "modifyVar",
      "scope": "buffData",
      "varName": "__fire",
      "op": "set",
      "value": 1,
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "compareVar",
        "scope": "buffData",
        "varName": "pool",
        "op": ">=",
        "val": {
         "ref": "buff.data.threshold"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "modifyVar",
      "scope": "buffData",
      "varName": "pool",
      "op": "sub",
      "value": {
       "ref": "buff.data.extra"
      },
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "compareVar",
        "scope": "buffData",
        "varName": "__fire",
        "op": "==",
        "val": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "rawDamage",
      "targetMode": "self",
      "flat": {
       "ref": "buff.data.extra"
      },
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "compareVar",
        "scope": "buffData",
        "varName": "__fire",
        "op": "==",
        "val": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "log",
      "text": "{target} 【{buff}】触发爆发 {buff.data.extra} 伤害",
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "compareVar",
        "scope": "buffData",
        "varName": "__fire",
        "op": "==",
        "val": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "event": "BUFF_EXPIRE",
    "filter": "self",
    "countAsLayer": false,
    "actions": [
     {
      "type": "modifyVar",
      "scope": "buff",
      "varName": "__b",
      "op": "set",
      "scaleFrom": "eventValue",
      "coef": 0.5,
      "plus": {
       "ref": "buff.data.extra2"
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "rawDamage",
      "targetMode": "self",
      "scaleFrom": "buffVar",
      "fromVar": "__b",
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "compareVar",
        "scope": "buff",
        "varName": "__b",
        "op": ">",
        "val": 0
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "log",
      "text": "{target} 【{buff}】爆发 {buffVar.__b} 伤害",
      "conditions": [
       {
        "type": "compareVar",
        "scope": "buff",
        "varName": "__b",
        "op": ">",
        "val": 0
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
